WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:24.211
First, here is Optus Store as a customer sees it on a phone today.

2
00:00:24.211 --> 00:00:28.215
It is a good store, with a catalogue of 109 products.

3
00:00:28.215 --> 00:00:30.492
But it lives in a browser tab.

4
00:00:30.492 --> 00:00:38.996
Every visit starts cold, with no icon on the home screen, no push notifications, and nothing to bring a customer back once they leave.

5
00:00:38.996 --> 00:00:41.424
Now, the same store as an app.

6
00:00:41.424 --> 00:00:45.813
It already uses your logo, your colours and your real products.

7
00:00:45.813 --> 00:00:49.534
Here is the home screen, with your banners and best sellers.

8
00:00:49.534 --> 00:00:51.081
Browsing is fast.

9
00:00:51.081 --> 00:00:56.963
Search, filter and sort across your full catalogue of 109 products.

10
00:00:56.963 --> 00:01:03.379
Open a product and you get the gallery, the sizes and the price in rupees, straight from your Shopify data.

11
00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:07.684
Add it to the bag, and bundles suggest the matching piece to go with it.

12
00:01:07.684 --> 00:01:11.512
Then the bag and checkout, which is your own Shopify checkout.

13
00:01:11.512 --> 00:01:17.516
Your payment methods, your shipping rules and your orders all stay exactly where they are today.

14
00:01:17.516 --> 00:01:20.499
We also looked at what your store already runs.

15
00:01:20.499 --> 00:01:22.537
GA4 for analytics.

16
00:01:22.537 --> 00:01:25.668
App events flow into the reports you already read.

17
00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:29.255
Nothing gets replaced and nothing needs to be rebuilt.

18
00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.727
Here is how we work.

19
00:01:30.727 --> 00:01:35.112
We audit your store first, then give you one fixed quote for the build.

20
00:01:35.112 --> 00:01:37.267
There are no hourly surprises.

21
00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:42.614
After launch, the app belongs to you, and we only stay on if you want support.

